From 499d2922b571d78721306f6092aa354db249ef14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RDoom <171243930+aeon1911@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:31:15 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 56/56] Vulkan only: OpenGL/GLES backends not built on the
 Switch
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

HAVE_OPENGL option (off in RDoom's build) drops the OpenGL backend and its
EGL/GL link; hw_noopengl.cpp keeps the few pieces the rest of the engine
uses. The Switch forces vid_preferbackend to Vulkan, a Vulkan failure is
fatal with a pointer to the session report. Loading screen credit:
Renan (Æon). Engine README rewritten for RDoom NX; legacy nx/ folder of the
earlier port removed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
